# Dashboard Layout

The Autosync visualization dashboard will organize climate information into clear sections.

## Section 1 - Temperature

Display temperature trends and sensor comparisons.

## Section 2 - Humidity

Display humidity trends and sensor-level differences.

## Section 3 - Location Comparison

Compare climate conditions between different locations.

## Section 4 - Microclimate Differences

Highlight differences between sensors and locations.

## Section 5 - Arbitrage Insights

Present visual information that can support identification of potential microclimate arbitrage opportunities.

## Goal

The dashboard should make climate patterns easy to understand and support the analysis performed by the project.
